/Branimir_Hrgota\" title=\"Branimir Hrgota\">Branimir Hrgota</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/J%C3%B6nk%C3%B6pings_S%C3%B6dra_IF\" title=\"Jönköpings Södra IF\">Jönköpings Södra IF</a> (18)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;hemmavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/GIF_Sundsvall\" title=\"GIF Sundsvall\">Sundsvall</a> 6–0 <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%84ngelholms_FF\" title=\"Ängelholms FF\">Ängelholm</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(30 september 2011)</span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Spelprogram&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Spelprogram-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;bortavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Qviding_FIF\" title=\"Qviding FIF\">Qviding</a> 0–5 <a href=\"/wiki/Assyriska_FF\" title=\"Assyriska FF\">Assyriska</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(22 oktober 2011)</span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Spelprogram&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Spelprogram-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Flest mål i en match</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4ster%C3%A5s_SK_Fotboll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Västerås SK Fotboll\">Västerås</a> 3–5 <a href=\"/wiki/Degerfors_IF\" title=\"Degerfors IF\">Degerfors</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(11 september 2011)</span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Spelprogram&#95;1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Spelprogram-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-ali